4n rooli ja selvit\u00e4 ep\u00e4ilytt\u00e4v\u00e4n kahvilan mysteeri. Soluttaudu, etsi todistusaineistoa, \u00e4l\u00e4k\u00e4 miss\u00e4\u00e4n nimess\u00e4 j\u00e4\u00e4 kiinni. \n\nPeli on tehty yhteisty\u00f6ss\u00e4 Metropolian kolmannen vuoden opiskelijoiden ja Ylen kanssa. \n\nLue lis\u00e4\u00e4: \nhttps://yle.fi/aihe/historia/kieltolaki \nhttp://gamesblogs.metropolia.fi/salakapakka/", "short_description": "Astu 1920-luvun Helsinkiin ja k\u00e4y tutkimaan salaper\u00e4ist\u00e4 mysteerikahvilaa."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "3092869367412511", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162702_760613700793011_4081331521003192320_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=s3XcAF_7qd4Q7kNvwERakQd&_nc_oc=AdpQs1lJKeJlRPWWNbtPm5MeBRehUDcwoX-XzMFZZ4gPqk7tB4auPkfanfRsTTeKO-Q&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af9cq-32mp2M1t5H8ICHnKFk5s-UrSKvoSjblc3kgEb05g&oe=6A2960D4"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "3052622228115034", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/12386286_555864938090815_4744680728720048128_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=V5sZK-xHbjMQ7kNvwHhrB3T&_nc_oc=AdqXieJn5PbP8QDfeQUNEuIlUb76CB2dzdHPqH2e6YoVPJmOUPLr5MuB60zsToya9YY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af_AELCLz9Ul8dkpaocW7xHxM-4AOFUgZhM1Vd3Au4A-7Q&oe=6A2965B2"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "635734543935653", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162754_583536608704930_1984236639773261824_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=nVbrSzbWdC4Q7kNvwG3OFUT&_nc_oc=AdpSFs8kCA-nUpfxnrQLjfN2E0DXwQLQTVfZW9IPp6ZJx2NpPUlq0RCIJyeUqAe3o60&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af_WHlMJbxa_gVa7NQ-fKWYCCrB2zaWkHwS-8v6BT4Mllg&oe=6A297355"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.p